<DocsLayout
  title="Paths & MSYS: the biggest behavioral difference"
  description="niubash accepts all four path dialects (C:\\, /d/, /mnt/d, /cygdrive/d); argv stays byte-for-byte verbatim with no MSYS runtime; uname reporting MSYS_NT is a deliberate compatibility persona; the write-side bare-drive gap is tracked in the open."
